# nexora-action-code: get_ip_interfaces
# Official Ruijie troubleshooting example; the page does not identify the OS version.
# https://www.ruijie.com.cn/fw/wt/36825/
Value Required INTERFACE (.+?)
Value IP_ADDRESS_PRI ((?:no\s+address)|\S+)
Value IP_ADDRESS_SEC ((?:no\s+address)|\S+)
Value STATUS (administratively down|up|down|\S+)
Value PROTOCOL (administratively down|up|down|\S+)

Start
  ^Interface\s+IP-Address\(Pri\)\s+IP-Address\(Sec\)\s+Status\s+Protocol\s*$$
  ^\s*${INTERFACE}\s{2,}${IP_ADDRESS_PRI}\s{2,}${IP_ADDRESS_SEC}\s{2,}${STATUS}\s{2,}${PROTOCOL}\s*$$ -> Record
